name mmap
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Include CMap resources in PDF files from pdfTeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package is an extension of cmap with improved flexibility
longdesc and coverage, including the ability to re-encode Knuth's basic
longdesc mathematics fonts.
